OL,3,GNEWSAGoogle refused 54K-name petition,
OL,4,Asay campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FProtesters claim Google's headquarters
OL,7,Fin London refused a petition of 54,000
OL,8,Fsignatories worried about the
OL,9,Fenvironmental impact of an Essex
OL,10,Fdevelopment.
OL,12,FThe tech giant plans to build four data
OL,13,Fcentre buildings, covering 130,500 sqm,
OL,14,Fand an office building on the former
OL,15,FArena Essex Raceway near Purfleet which
OL,16,Fclosed in 2018.
OL,18,FThe 52 hectares of land became a Local
OL,19,FWildlife Site in 2006 and
OL,20,Fconservationists said the development
OL,21,Fwould threaten rare bumblebees and
OL,22,Fendangered broad-leaved cudweed.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
