OL,3,GNEWSAGoogle refused 54K-name petition,
OL,4,Asay campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle would not confirm or deny that
OL,7,Fit refused the petition on Wednesday,
OL,8,Fbut said data centres were "vital" and
OL,9,Fthat the firm was taking its
OL,10,Fenvironmental responsibilities "very
OL,11,Fseriously".
